Setup               fargo_nu

### Disk parameters 
AspectRatio         0.05                Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0              1.0                 Surface Density at r=1
Nu                  1.0e-5                Constant kinematic viscosity
#Alpha               0.0 # 4.0e-3              Uniform kinematic viscosity
SigmaSlope          1.5                 Slope for the surface density
FlaringIndex        0.5                 Slope for the aspect-ratio

# Radial range for damping (in period-ratios). For example, for
# the default value 1.15, the wave-killing zones have a width
# approximately equal to 10% of the mesh edge radius (since
# 1.15^(2/3) ~ 1.10).
#  Values smaller than one prevent damping.

# 1.30 makes wkz's at [0.4,0.48] and [2.1,2.5]
DampingZone         1.30  # 1.15 

# Characteristic time for damping, in units of the inverse local
# orbital frequency. Higher values means lower damping

TauDamp             1.0     # 0.3

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/jupiter.cfg
# potential smoothing length = ThicknessSmoothing * H
ThicknessSmoothing  0.6
IndirectTerm        Yes

### Mesh parameters

Nx                  384                     Azimuthal number of zones
Ny                  128                     Radial number of zones
Xmin               -3.14159265358979323844  Lower boundary in azimuth
Xmax                3.14159265358979323844  Upper boundary in azimuth
Ymin                0.4                     Inner boundary radius
Ymax                2.5                     Outer boundary radius

#Spacing             N                       Non-uniform spacing from a mesh-density function
#XMa                 0.1                     
#XMb                 0.2
#XMc                 5.0

#YMa                 0.1
#YMb                 0.2
#YMc                 5.0
#YMy0                1.0

# G = frame corotates with planet 0's guiding center
Frame               G                       Method for moving the frame of reference
OmegaFrame          1.0005                  Angular velocity for the frame of reference (If Frame is F).

### Output control parameters

DT              0.314159265359              Physical time between fine-grain outputs
Ninterm         10                          Number of DTs between scalar fields outputs
Ntot            1000                        Total number of DTs

# output directory
OutputDir       @outputs/fargo_nu
